<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean and products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NB-no buyer NS-no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	BASIS	 MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	   30/25 D     April	  27/20 D</p>
<p> May	     27/25 D     May	    26/20 D</p>
<p> July	   even/2 P     July	   16/10 D</p>
<p> August	  12/15 P     August	 14/20 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS     MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	     NB/NS     April	  16/14 D</p>
<p> May	 17.5/15.5 D     May	  17/15.5 D</p>
<p> July	    18/16 D     July	   18/16 D</p>
<p> August	  14/10 D     August	  12/9 D</p>
<p> SHIPMENT    BASIS	 MONTH	PREV</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	     NB/NS     April	  90 D/NS</p>
<p> May	     75 D/NS     May	    90 D/NS</p>
<p> July	  130/110 D     July	 135/120 D</p>
<p> August	 135/95 D     August     140/115 D</p>
